        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nOne remaining `.slice(0, N)` truncation site in `embedded-agent-subscribe.handlers.tools.ts` was missed when `truncateUtf16Safe` was introduced elsewhere in the same file (line 415). It may cut UTF-16 surrogate pairs in half when the raw args preview contains multi-byte characters such as emoji.\n\n## Changes\n\n- `src/agents/embedded-agent-subscribe.handlers.tools.ts`: replace the remaining `rawArgsPreview?.slice(0, TOOL_START_WARNING_RAW_PREVIEW_MAX_CHARS)` with `truncateUtf16Safe`.\n\nLabel: bugfix | merge-risk: 🟢 minimal",
